ities. But you are not alone. A mysterious newborn creature desperately needs your help to survive. Your mission? Work together, solve puzzles and find a way to escape before the shadows lurking in the house catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/eb7775b8146684dc38a10a5f4d567e9f.poster.avif?t=1761550252\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/eb7775b8146684dc38a10a5f4d567e9f.webm?t=1761550252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/eb7775b8146684dc38a10a5f4d567e9f.mp4?t=1761550252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles and Interact with the Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie rooms, manipulate objects, and use the environment to your advantage to overcome obstacles and dangers. Each puzzle is designed to take full advantage of virtual reality, offering a highly immersive and realistic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/30f3f56d83abaccb715f8ce5dc8748cc.poster.avif?t=1761550252\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/30f3f56d83abaccb715f8ce5dc8748cc.webm?t=1761550252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/30f3f56d83abaccb715f8ce5dc8748cc.mp4?t=1761550252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect a Unique Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The small creature by your side is more than just a traveling companion\u2014it\u2019s a key part of the gameplay. Communicate with it, understand its needs and combine your abilities to survive. But be careful\u2026 if it falls into the wrong hands, it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/7c56f203c9b84f09585960d5e2eb77b9.poster.avif?t=1761550252\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/7c56f203c9b84f09585960d5e2eb77b9.webm?t=1761550252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/extras/7c56f203c9b84f09585960d5e2eb77b9.mp4?t=1761550252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the Shadows That Hunt You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in this house. Something evil lurks in the darkness, watching you. You\u2019ll need to move carefully, stay silent and find ways to outsmart the creatures that are after you.</p>","developers":["Erupting Moka"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591770/e1c99ac80d5599ad001f6e7b9680ba2558d36fb3/header.jpg?t=1761550252","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3591770/327912809/1929174dfbcea1b8a33f4178c19e3693